- lib/activity-ledger.ts: tolerant ledger.jsonl loader (skip bad lines, newest-first,
  500 cap) + pure groupByDay/trustLine helpers; 5 unit tests (node-safe window stub)
- /ledger page: day-grouped feed w/ mono timestamps, area chips, written paths,
  sticky 'Sent nothing. Submitted nothing.' trust header, focus+manual refresh,
  honest empty state; student sidebar nav directly under Today
- Today trust stripe now navigates to /ledger
